WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:01.750
- [Waiter] What can we getcha?

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.710
- Directions to Belburg Valley Farm.

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:04.639
I'm the new owner.

00:00:04.639 --> 00:00:06.500
(dish shatters)

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.333
Oh.

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:08.166
- In from America, right?

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:11.280
I bet there's an intriguing
backstory to your arrival.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.700
- [Gabriela] Well, after losing my job

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.210
and my boyfriend in San Fransico,

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.687
I entered a Win an Inn contest.

00:00:16.687 --> 00:00:18.310
- [Computerized Voice] You've won an inn.

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:19.810
Located in New Zealand.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.150
- [Gabriela] So a 13
hour flight to Auckland

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:23.926
and three bus rides later

00:00:23.926 --> 00:00:24.759
(horn honks)

00:00:24.759 --> 00:00:25.592
(vehicle crashes)

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:26.425
(woman screams)

00:00:26.425 --> 00:00:27.258
I'm so sorry.

00:00:27.258 --> 00:00:28.890
I will pay for any of the damages.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.795
- Well this did put a
big dent in my vehicle.

00:00:31.795 --> 00:00:33.130
- Ha. Ha.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.023
I'm officially the owner of an inn.

00:00:36.641 --> 00:00:38.629
(goat bleats in background)

00:00:38.629 --> 00:00:39.654
Ugh.

00:00:39.654 --> 00:00:40.596
(rooster crows)

00:00:40.596 --> 00:00:41.429
(wooden stair breaks)

00:00:41.429 --> 00:00:42.730
Never assume anything on the internet

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.808
matches its profile picture.

00:00:44.808 --> 00:00:45.708
(goat bleats)

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:47.228
(woman screams)

00:00:47.228 --> 00:00:48.061
(two women scream)

00:00:48.061 --> 00:00:49.127
- You look like you've seen a ghost.

00:00:49.127 --> 00:00:49.983
- Goat.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.240
- Gilbert.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.488
He's a wily fella.

00:00:52.488 --> 00:00:53.516
(goat bleats)

00:00:53.516 --> 00:00:54.510
(upbeat music)

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:55.710
- [Gabriela] Do you know anybody in town

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:56.880
that does renovations?

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:57.713
- Jake Taylor.

00:00:57.713 --> 00:00:58.590
- Can I have his phone number?

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.050
- [Storekeeper] Jake,
what's your phone number?

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:00.883
- Who's asking?

00:01:00.883 --> 00:01:01.760
- [Storekeeper] She is.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:02.650
- No I didn't.

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:04.080
- Why do you want my number?

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:04.940
- [Gabriela] I was hoping to talk to you

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:05.773
about a proposition.

00:01:05.773 --> 00:01:06.606
(car doors slam)

00:01:06.606 --> 00:01:07.590
- [Jake] She's a real beauty.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.840
I can help you restore
her to original glory.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:11.920
Brilliant.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:12.843
- You see, broken.

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:15.576
What's with you and the old houses?

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:17.200
- Well I always took to building.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.681
Makes me feel a little less

00:01:18.681 --> 00:01:19.514
- Little less broken?

00:01:19.514 --> 00:01:22.460
- [Townswoman] I believe Beechwood Downs'

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:25.400
most eligible bachelor
might be keen on you.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:27.040
- [Gabriela] She's a beaut.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:28.546
- She sure is.

00:01:28.546 --> 00:01:32.629
♪ We don't care ♪

00:01:33.807 --> 00:01:34.640
- Wow.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:37.058
(upbeat music)

00:01:37.058 --> 00:01:37.891
Hey, Ted.

00:01:37.891 --> 00:01:38.930
- Diaz, guess what.

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:40.673
I got a brand new job for you.

00:01:42.587 --> 00:01:43.440
(upbeat music)

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:44.273
- I do have my real life to get back to.

00:01:44.273 --> 00:01:46.312
- Oh, your real life.

00:01:46.312 --> 00:01:48.380
- [Townswoman] Seems to
me, you haven't told her

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.829
how you actually feel.

00:01:49.829 --> 00:01:50.662
Upbeat music.

00:01:50.662 --> 00:01:51.878
(shouts)

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:54.934
- I'm guessing the universe has
its own plans for things eh?

00:01:54.934 --> 00:01:57.213
- I like to imagine a fairytale ending.

00:01:57.213 --> 00:02:00.708
(upbeat music)

00:02:00.708 --> 00:02:03.708
(woman screams)

00:02:05.599 --> 00:02:07.497
(goat bleats)

00:02:07.497 --> 00:02:09.221
- I thought we were friends, mate.

00:02:09.221 --> 00:02:14.221
(upbeat music)

